    "386": {
      "date": "2026-11-14",
      "edition": "Saturday 14 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Max Ojomoh recalled at 12 as Steve Borthwick reinstates him for Japan",
          "body": "Bath centre Max Ojomoh is back in England's plans after being initially left out of England head coach Steve Borthwick's training squad, and returns at 12. He has not played for England since man-of-the-match against Argentina a year ago. Borthwick wants more than skill from the position: \"You have to be incredibly skilled in that position, but it demands a skill and toughness it previously probably didn't,\" he told BBC Sport. Ojomoh partners George Ford, who returns to fly-half, with Henry Pollock starting too."
        },
