    "389": {
      "date": "2026-11-14",
      "edition": "Saturday 14 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Captain's review",
          "heading": "Giacomo Nicotera says Italy's self-review after 7-66 Springboks defeat was harsh",
          "body": "Italy captain Giacomo Nicotera said the squad had been very critical after the 7-66 defeat to South Africa, reviewing aerial play, defence, organisation and discipline. Too many penalties, partly driven by South Africa's breakdown pressure, were something Italy can and must control. The Monday review was tough, Nicotera said, with players pushing each other for a sharper response in training. Ahead of Saturday's fifth-round Nations Championship test against Argentina, winning enough ball was fundamental, he added."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Beauden Barrett replaces Codie Taylor as All Blacks captain",
