          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Graham and Kinghorn return as Townsend keeps pack unchanged for Australia",
          "body": "Scotland head coach Gregor Townsend has restored Darcy Graham and Blair Kinghorn to his starting XV for the Test against Australia at Murrayfield. Kinghorn takes over at full-back from Kyle Rowe, who is not in the squad, while Graham returns on the left wing as Jamie Dobie drops to the bench. Graham, Scotland's all-time leading try scorer, recovered from a bicep tear more quickly than expected. The starting pack is unchanged and back-row Ollie Leatherbarrow could earn a first cap from the bench."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
