          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Steve Tandy makes four changes, Taine Basham coming in at No. 8",
          "body": "Planet Rugby reports that Taine Basham comes in at number eight, James Botham at blindside flank, Adam Beard at lock and Gabriel Hamer-Webb on the left wing for Saturday's Nations Championship test against New Zealand at the Principality Stadium. The changes follow a 28-21 win over Japan in which, as Planet Rugby puts it, Wales had to dig deep and their overall performance left a lot to be desired. BBC Sport adds that number eight Aaron Wainwright will be missed against New Zealand because of injury."
