      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Coaching pressure",
          "heading": "Felipe Contepomi says winning matters, but Pumas need stability first against Italy",
          "body": "Under heavy criticism after defeats to Scotland and England, Argentina head coach Felipe Contepomi used his pre-match press conference to accept that results count but argue they must come from a process. For him, the route to victory is doing the basics to the highest standard all week, the only part the team controls, rather than chasing a result at all costs. Argentina's only win this calendar year came against Wales, and Italy is the next test of that approach."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Beauden Barrett replaces Codie Taylor as All Blacks captain",
          "body": "Tadhg Beirne named Ireland captain for Fiji game. Wales' Aaron Wainwright misses New Zealand Test through injury. Wallabies recall Carter Gordon at flyhalf after broken leg."
