          "heading": "Les Kiss recalls Carter Gordon at flyhalf as Declan Meredith is dropped",
          "body": "Wallabies coach Les Kiss has restored Carter Gordon and Rob Valetini to the starting XV for Sunday's Nations Championship match against Scotland at Murrayfield. Gordon is back from a broken leg, and Kiss said: \"Certainly Carter was the incumbent, so he was in a position of strength before he got injured.\" Declan Meredith has been dropped from the match-day 23. Australia have used seven different starting flyhalves since the last World Cup."
