      "edition": "Saturday 14 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Borthwick names Max Ojomoh and Henry Pollock in England side for Japan",
          "body": "Ten personnel changes and two positional switches mark England head coach Steve Borthwick's team for Saturday's Twickenham fixture with Japan. Centre Max Ojomoh returns after his man-of-the-match display against Argentina a year ago, and Henry Pollock starts after scoring two tries from the wing against Australia. Japan, who have never beaten England in six attempts and sit 10th of 12 on the log, face a side reshaped for this test."
        },
        {
